{"id":"n40653-2-7","stage":4,"title":"내보이다 · 显露","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40653-2-7-1","ko":"나는 민준이 속을 도대체 모르겠어.","zh":"我真搞不懂敏俊心里在想什么啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이","audio":"/audio/32f61c157245f6426f6e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이","audio":"/audio/32f61c157245f6426f6e.mp3"}},{"text":"속을","meaning":"心思，心眼","explanation":"속：心思，心眼；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"5","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"속을","audio":"/audio/b9f2556789370ea8cdd9.mp3"}},{"text":"도대체","meaning":"到底，究竟","explanation":"도대체：到底，究竟。","readings":[{"term":"도대체","audio":"/audio/5961e5da228541d4e036.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14385","senseId":"3","lemma":"도대체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도대체","audio":"/audio/5961e5da228541d4e036.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어","audio":"/audio/b0a5887fc79197b11412.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"27e1c3f6a82b5a8b","term":"속","zh":"心思，心眼","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3","entryI