7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이","audio":"/audio/3f33d9d6ca9be288c4e3.mp3"}},{"text":"아니잖아.","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"아니잖아","audio":"/audio/ffe86251f32d69d5c616.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니잖아","audio":"/audio/ffe86251f32d69d5c616.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc5331dd64d187d4","term":"원래","zh":"原来，本来","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3","entryId":"53768","definition":"从一开始；或指从根本上。","pronunciation":["월래"]},{"id":"2414d9a35546c0c9","term":"속마음","zh":"内心，心思","audio":"/audio/2414d9a35546c0c9fd96.mp3","entryId":"15590","definition":"不外露的实际的心意。","pronunciation":["송ː마음"]},{"id":"190590ebae043637","term":"겉","zh":"外表，表面","audio":"/audio/190590ebae043637dc00.mp3","entryId":"31329","definition":"指显现在外的样子或现象。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"d3871d1453203629","term":"내보이다","zh":"显露，展露，露出","audio":"/audio/d3871d14532036297ccc.mp3","entryId":"40653","definition":"将内心显露出来。","pronunciation":["내보이다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]}],"audio":"/audio/ede54aeacd3d79e6598d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.109,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40653","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":148,"sequenceScore":2.9357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我真搞不懂敏俊心里在想什么啊。","他本来就不是那种会把心里话表露出来的人啊。","最近脸上皱纹变多了，真让人头疼。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我真搞不懂敏俊心里在想什么啊。","他本来就不是那种会把心里话表露出来的人啊。","最近脸上皱纹变多了，真让人头疼。"],"answer":1}]}
